~ start

NONI: [speed=1.5][wave amp=5 freq=5]Oh! Tatay is here![/wave][/speed]

#[Animation of Tatay stops the vehicle and gets out.]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.4]Put your bags in the back. [speed=1.7]Hurry up.[/speed] We need to get past the main road before traffic gets worse.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.2]Hello, Tay! Did you finish harvesting the coconuts today?[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0]Most of them. We had to haul the copra before the rain came. [speed=0.9]Can't let it get wet and ruin the harvest.[/speed]

[speed=0.6]I hope it doesn't rain too much...[/speed]

ERNESTO: ...

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0][shake rate=3 level=2]What's all that?[/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2]Huh?[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0][shake rate=4 level=2]Did you really have to spend your money at the stalls again?[/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.8]No, Tay... I was just watching Noni near the stalls. He... he just wanted a little snack.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0]And I told you to save your money. [speed=1.2][shake rate=3 level=2]Do you think it's easy to earn it?[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]Money doesn't just appear out of nowhere, anak.[/speed] [speed=0.8]Every peso you spend out here is every coconut I had to climb and harvest under the blistering sun just so that we have food on the table.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.8]But-[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]If the rain ruins our crops or the buyers lower their prices, we'll lose money we need.[/speed] [speed=0.8]Nobody will help us.[/speed] [speed=0.7]The bank will not care and the vendors will not give us free food.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=3]The world won’t care if we are tired or hungry.[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]So please... [speed=0.8]don't waste money on things we don't need.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8]I'm doing this for our family.[/speed] [speed=0.7]I just need you to understand that.[/speed]

ERNESTO: ...

[speed=0.5]Oh...[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Tatay always get tired like this every time he goes to work...[/speed]

[speed=0.5]I want to help him... [wait=0.8]but what can I even do?[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.6]...Sorry, Tay.[/speed]

ERNESTO: ...

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]Let's just go home.[/speed] [speed=1.0]Climb up and hold on to the rails tightly.[/speed]

=> END